2. AFTER THE EVALUATION PERIOD
   Training new models, the dashboard, and the weight downloader stop working.
   Scoring images with models you already trained keeps working, so a line that
   is already running does not stop.
   Continued use of the training features requires a commercial license.
   To obtain one, contact:  pashidl.lab@gmail.com

